            0.777,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. While diluting an acid, why is it recommended that the acid should be added to water and not water to the acid?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
